discussion_comments.comment_body:
**[Suggestion]** Fragment flattening test asserts `toHaveLength(2)` on menuitems but never checks their text content. If `actionMenuLabel` returned an incorrect label for Fragment children, this test would still pass.

**Failure scenario:** A regression in `actionMenuLabel` that returns `undefined` or a wrong string for Fragment-wrapped actions produces menuitems with empty or wrong labels. The count assertion passes; the label defect ships undetected.

```suggestion
    const items = menu!.querySelectorAll('[role="menuitem"]');
    expect(items).toHaveLength(2);
    expect(items[0]?.textContent).toBe('Env');
    expect(items[1]?.textContent).toBe('Share');
```

<details>
<summary>中文说明</summary>

**[Suggestion]** Fragment 展平测试只验证了菜单项数量为 2，但未检查其文本内容。如果 `actionMenuLabel` 对 Fragment 子元素返回错误标签，此测试仍会通过。建议添加 `textContent` 断言。

</details>

