**[Suggestion]** The `mouseButton` parameter in the `pointer` helper is declared but never exercised with a non-zero value, leaving the `event.button !== 0` guard in `handlePointerDown` untested.

Failure scenario: if the `event.button !== 0` guard were removed, right-clicking the voice button in hold mode would start dictation — no existing test would catch this regression.

